WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,000
Can you make up a little one? Yes, no problem.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,320
But it will take two days

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,520
I won’t charge you for the materials. I’ll give you the bamboo for free.

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,480
Charge a craft fee

5
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,480
Hardware can be peeled off

6
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:10,160
Anyway, they are all from the Cow Horse Team.

7
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,480
My character is worth it

8
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,160
Brother Fang, what do you think?

9
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,120
No problem, hardware meat

10
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,440
Plus five crayfish

11
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:18,520
Don't be in a hurry, just go as fast as you can

12
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,440
I'm not in a hurry

13
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:20,920
Okay, thank you very much.

14
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:24,440
Happy cooperation

15
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:26,120
Brother, be careful

16
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,360
There are also wax strips over there.

17
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,560
I've seen it before

18
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,920
I was shocked at that time.

19
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:35,990
we will pay attention

20
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:38,570
And Senior Crab

21
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:39,810
It seems that at the beginning, their siblings

22
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:41,450
I forgot about crabs

23
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:43,220
They didn't even move it

24
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,820
I probably didn't remember it.

25
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:48,580
Otherwise they will definitely move too

26
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:52,560
Senior, it’s a female

27
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:53,960
Forget it, mother

28
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:55,440
Those little crabs are so densely packed

29
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:57,460
It looks bad, but we can

30
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:58,940
Catch it back and raise it

31
00:00:58,940 --> 00:01:01,330
There just happen to be so many little crab hatchlings

32
00:01:01,330 --> 00:01:02,930
Okay, then I'll put it up
